# What a build writes. It is made again from the files beside it, so it is
# never committed.
/dist/

# The checkout of Prusa Connect a build takes the unpublished sdk from. The
# marketplace builder writes it here itself; locally it is a relative symlink
# to ../prusa-connect. Either way it is someone else's tree, not this one, so
# it is never committed.
/.core

# The browser bundle's own build, made again from the files beside it. `dist/`
# above is the release the module's install reads on the host; this is Vite's,
# inside the bundle's project, and it never travels: the marketplace builder
# builds it from these sources and copies the result into the release itself.
/ui/dist/

# The driven harness's own build, from the page beside it. It is a page a browser
# is pointed at to prove a screen, not a thing the module serves.
/ui/harness-clock/dist/

/ui/node_modules/
